  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "opening",
      "index": "01",
      "title": "翻开故事书",
      "heading": "拔苗助长",
      "visual": "book",
      "startFrame": 0,
      "durationInFrames": 394,
      "durationSeconds": 13.133333333333333,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "opening-0-9f5062e5e0.m4a",
          "text": "你好，我是小禾。今天，一起听一个拔苗助长的故事。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 154,
          "durationSeconds": 5.12
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "opening-1-6325dd80a9.m4a",
          "text": "小苗还没长高，能不能拉一拉，帮它快点长大呢？",
          "startFrame": 192,
          "durationInFrames": 130,
          "durationSeconds": 4.32
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "garden",
      "index": "02",
      "title": "农夫的小苗",
      "heading": "快快长大吧",
      "visual": "garden",
      "startFrame": 394,
      "durationInFrames": 373,
      "durationSeconds": 12.433333333333334,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "garden-0-7715bcfe99.m4a",
          "text": "从前，有位农夫种了一田小苗。嫩绿的小叶子，真可爱！",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 164,
          "durationSeconds": 5.44
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "garden-1-c8451936b4.m4a",
          "text": "他每天都去看，盼着小苗快快长高。",
          "startFrame": 202,
          "durationInFrames": 99,
          "durationSeconds": 3.28
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "waiting",
      "index": "03",
      "title": "着急的农夫",
      "heading": "怎么还不长呀？",
      "visual": "waiting",
      "startFrame": 767,
      "durationInFrames": 324,
      "durationSeconds": 10.8,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "waiting-0-8f441b36da.m4a",
          "text": "可是，才过了一天，小苗看起来和昨天差不多。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 118,
          "durationSeconds": 3.92
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "waiting-1-cace8ee99b.m4a",
          "text": "农夫急了：怎么还不长呀？我来帮帮你们！",
          "startFrame": 156,
          "durationInFrames": 96,
          "durationSeconds": 3.2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pulling",
      "index": "04",
      "title": "往上拔一拔",
      "heading": "高了一点点？",
      "visual": "pulling",
      "startFrame": 1091,
      "durationInFrames": 370,
      "durationSeconds": 12.333333333333334,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "pulling-0-67636bf3f8.m4a",
          "text": "他弯下腰，把小苗一棵一棵，往上拔了一点点。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 147,
          "durationSeconds": 4.88
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "pulling-1-59333f54c6.m4a",
          "text": "看！一下子高了这么多！农夫得意地笑了。",
          "startFrame": 185,
          "durationInFrames": 113,
          "durationSeconds": 3.76
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "guess",
      "index": "05",
      "title": "你猜会怎样",
      "heading": "小苗真的长大了吗？",
      "visual": "guess",
      "startFrame": 1461,
      "durationInFrames": 288,
      "durationSeconds": 9.6,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "guess-0-1af985c8b8.m4a",
          "text": "小朋友，你猜，小苗真的长大了吗？想一想，再告诉小禾。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 192,
          "durationSeconds": 6.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "result",
      "index": "06",
      "title": "小苗低下了头",
      "heading": "根，离开了泥土",
      "visual": "result",
      "startFrame": 1749,
      "durationInFrames": 414,
      "durationSeconds": 13.8,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "result-0-bd84bd3a40.m4a",
          "text": "第二天，小苗垂下了叶子。根被拔松了，小苗就没法好好吸水。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 176,
          "durationSeconds": 5.84
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "result-1-f124d889d8.m4a",
          "text": "农夫这才明白：我太着急，反而伤害了小苗。",
          "startFrame": 214,
          "durationInFrames": 128,
          "durationSeconds": 4.24
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson",
      "index": "07",
      "title": "长大有自己的节奏",
      "heading": "照顾它，也等一等",
      "visual": "lesson",
      "startFrame": 2163,
      "durationInFrames": 401,
      "durationSeconds": 13.366666666666667,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "lesson-0-65a26bb5c8.m4a",
          "text": "这就是拔苗助长。急着成功，用错了办法，反而把事情弄糟。",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 166,
          "durationSeconds": 5.52
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "lesson-1-fc84a86a45.m4a",
          "text": "小苗需要合适的水分、阳光，还有时间，慢慢长大。",
          "startFrame": 204,
          "durationInFrames": 125,
          "durationSeconds": 4.16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "index": "08",
      "title": "轮到你想一想",
      "heading": "一点一点，慢慢来",
      "visual": "ending",
      "startFrame": 2564,
      "durationInFrames": 432,
      "durationSeconds": 14.4,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "file": "ending-0-4b33776366.m4a",
          "text": "如果你种的小豆芽还没长高，你会拔一拔，还是照顾它，再等等呢？",
          "startFrame": 24,
          "durationInFrames": 156,
          "durationSeconds": 5.2
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "file": "ending-1-b0af5b1a0b.m4a",
          "text": "学骑车、学画画也一样。认真练习，一点一点来。我们下个故事见！",
          "startFrame": 194,
          "durationInFrames": 166,
          "durationSeconds": 5.52
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
